  "releaseNotes": "'## [15.0.0-prerelease.1](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v14.1.0...v15.0.0-prerelease.1) (2026-11-24)\n\n### ⚠ BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* See the [migration guide](https://dotnet.github.io/dotnet-operator-sdk/docs/operator/migration#upgrading-from-v14-to-v15) for upgrading from v14 to v15.\n* **aspire:** build AddKubeOps on path-based Aspire 17 projects (#1340)\n\n### Features\n\n* **aspire:** build AddKubeOps on path-based Aspire 17 projects ([#1340](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1340)) ([efeb280](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/efeb2804b98f88bf6929c7d5d7469d8b79e3b886))\n'",
